  appears he has the upper hand until a  hardened pillar pierces through him the  warhammer titan finishes its  transformation and constructs a hammer  to fight aaron as the battle continues  aaron strategically uses each of his  titan transformations to assess the  warhammer strength until he discovers  that the user of the titan is located  underground transforming back into the  attack titan he sees a hole in the  street from where a long cable of flesh  comes out attached to the warhammer  titan aaron reaches in and grabs the  crystallized body of laura tiber  severing her connection and disabling  the warhammer when he bites the crystal  he breaks his titan's jaw on the  hardened surface well aaron being the  smart man he is he realized that he can  use the jaw titan to break the crystal  and eat the warhammer and he did in the  most epic way possible  number four aaron's second fight against  the female titan  [Applause]  every major fight in the anime always  deserves a rematch an attack on titan  just had to give us a round two of aaron  against the female titan when annie is  revealed as the female titan aaron  immediately becomes delusional he  struggles to believe that the female  titan who murdered his friends is the  same comrade who trained with him for  years while she continues to kill more  scouts aaron tries to transform into his  titan form but cannot due to the shock  and disbelief at annie's betrayal he is  reminded of the lives annie took as the  female titan as well as his vow to  exterminate the titans allowing him to  finally overcome his doubts and  transform into the attack titan the two  titans start battling each other and  crushing anything that comes in their  way even though aaron is in better  control of his titan this time around he  is ultimately no match for annie's  superior fighting technique and  hardening abilities and he gets beaten  up again but in the end with a little  help from mikasa he manages to pin down  the female ti