 attempts to subdue reiner  with the submission hold aaron begins  applying pressure to his nape causing  its armor to crack however before he can  break reiner out of his titan reiner  begins roaring causing berthold's titan  to roll off the top of the wall landing  atop both of them wow talking about an  intense scene  number one declaration of war  imagine walking into a room and seeing a  ghost well that's exactly how reiner  felt when he was led to a basement by  falco where aaron was waiting for him  upon reiner's arrival he asks aaron why  he's in marley and aaron responds that  he is there for the same reason as  reiner he has no choice revealing that  he has already slit his hand in  preparation to transform if need be  aaron insists that reiner sit with him  to listen to the play overhearing willy  claim that aaron is a rebel against  peace and that he admits that he is  indeed the bad guy but argues that  warriors were also the bad guys when  they invaded walmaria he admits that he  understands the suffering reiner went  through causing the latter to break down  and ask that aaron kill him what is  amazing in this scene is that we got to  see a whole new aaron the one who comes  to see more lands as humans and even as  good people it is the peak of aaron's  self-hatred as he has now become the  same as the people he swore to  exterminate as he helped reiner to his  feet aaron says that he now understands  that they are the same and declares that  he will continue until he wipes out his  enemies transforming into the attack  titan aaron breaks out of the building  and in the most legendary way kills  willie tiber declaring the war to the  entire world  is he still the good guy or did he turn  evil it's up to you to decide and we  will see you guys in the next video bye

